# Default comic scene references/local guides require NO .env or provider keys.
# Native Codex image tools use the current session; not OPENAI_API_KEY here.
# A key being configured does NOT opt you into provider calls.

# OPTIONAL: only for explicit World Labs/Marble 3D generation.
# API credits are separate provider billing, not Codex/ChatGPT entitlement.
# WORLD_LABS_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL: explicit legacy FAL edits, Hunyuan/Meshy objects, or SFX.
# FAL-backed image edits are not required for native clean plates/references.
# FAL_KEY=
